From f355ee9d5d31fddf1e5d9c777819f6c1bed24560 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: perf <perf@local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:53:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf: reduce redundant timers, polling, log IO and
 per-request work

- server/sfu.js: cache client RTP capabilities per router (no deep clone per transport)
- server/sfu.js: gate per-resync get-producers log behind SFU_DEBUG
- server/index.js: skip persisting identical room JSON (drop redundant sync disk writes)
- js/sync.js: heartbeat 4s -> 15s (Socket.IO keepalive already covers liveness)
- js/host.js: get-room polling 3s -> 15s while socket is connected
- js/speaking-indicator.js: skip DOM scan when no audio source, reuse spotlight measurement
- js/webrtc/mic-pipeline.js: compute output RMS once per tick
- js/webrtc/{host-publisher,viewer-subscriber}.js: pause 4s producer resync while tab hidden
---
 js/host.js                     |  5 ++++-
 js/speaking-indicator.js       |  9 +++++++--
 js/sync.js                     |  5 +++--
 js/webrtc/host-publisher.js    |  2 ++
 js/webrtc/mic-pipeline.js      |  6 ++++--
 js/webrtc/viewer-subscriber.js |  2 ++
 server/index.js                |  9 ++++++++-
 server/sfu.js                  | 12 +++++++++---
 8 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

